_olex2_refinement_description
;
1. Fixed Uiso
 At 1.2 times of:
  H2 of N2, H2A of C2, H3 of C3, H5 of C5, H8 of C8, H9 of C9, {H10A,H10B} of
  C10, {H11A,H11B} of C11
 At 1.5 times of:
  {H15A,H15B,H15C} of C15
2. Uiso/Uaniso restraints and constraints
Uanis(C10) ~ Ueq, Uanis(C11) ~ Ueq, Uanis(C9) ~ Ueq: with sigma of 0.01 and 
sigma for terminal atoms of 0.02
3.a Secondary CH2 refined with riding coordinates:
 C10(H10A,H10B), C11(H11A,H11B)
3.b Aromatic/amide H refined with riding coordinates:
 N2(H2), C2(H2A), C3(H3), C5(H5), C8(H8), C9(H9)
3.c Idealised Me refined as rotating group:
 C15(H15A,H15B,H15C)
;
